Now we need to allocate dispatch slots and execute dispatches for all four candidates.

We need dispatch_slot_alpha available (init true). We'll allocate to each candidate sequentially; after each allocation, dispatch_slot_available becomes false; after we execute dispatch, effect makes dispatch_slot_available true again (since execute_*_dispatch has effect dispatch_slot_available). So we can reuse same slot for multiple candidates sequentially.

